directories are uid501/gid0, no ACL entries displayed, flags`-`, with
com.apple.provenance xattr11 bytes. This is actual ls -ldeO@ evidence, not proof
of every possible hidden authorization policy. Member controls change only the
owned target's group to the caller's legitimate gid20.

Installed binary:
`tests/commands/metadata-stress/.oracle/coreutils-9.7/src/chmod`
Version: chmod (GNU coreutils)9.7; Mach-O arm64, linked to libSystem.B.dylib.
