Matches the authenticated frozen prerequisites and historical SGID archive.
host-tool-identity.json also records Node/bash executable hashes and version text.

Separate controls, repeated for both snapshots, NOT extra parity acceptance tests:

- gid20 directory06755, +2000: all five layers0/06755, genuine already-set SGID.
- gid20 directory0755, ug+s: all five layers0/06755, genuine new SGID.
- gid20 regular file0644, ug+s: all five layers0/06644; bytes00ff0a unchanged.
- gid0 directory0755, u+rwx,g=rx,o=rx: all layers0/0755; no SGID request.
- Parent directory0000, child0600, chmod -- 644 blocked/file: GNU status1,
  raw Node rejects EACCES, direct RealFS throws typed FsError(EACCES) with virtual
  path `/work/blocked/file`, real metadata command status1. Child mode, ctime and
